flowchart LR
	GAP["the regression the harness could not see -<br/>terminal file edits are invisible to fs/observed<br/>it fires only on tool-layer writes"]
	BYPASS["a sed -i bypassed the governor,<br/>the pinner and the normalize plugins entirely"]
	COACH["the coach goes where that regression flows -<br/>over bash and pwsh"]
	LADDER["the four-tier ladder over the terminal tool calls -<br/>ledger lines, coaching notes, a system-prompt section,<br/>the optional enforce deny tier"]
	DETECT["adversarial detection - the pipeline strips heredoc bodies,<br/>collapses $(...) substitutions and quote layers,<br/>scans intent markers and a craft library"]
	CATCHALL["the write-intent catch-all -<br/>novel zero-day forms still count"]
	NOTE["every note names the correct tool with its LIVE<br/>registry description - the dynamic ctx.tools.schemas() fetch"]
	GAP --> BYPASS
	BYPASS --> COACH
	COACH --> LADDER
	DETECT --> LADDER
	CATCHALL --> LADDER
	LADDER --> NOTE
